---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeading from '../components/PageHeading.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="Privacy" description="How the Etern Destinations static website handles visitor information and links to external services.">
  <PageHeading label="THE SMALL PRINT" title="Your privacy matters." description="A simple explanation of how this website works."/>
  <article class="container prose"><h2>This website</h2><p>This is a static information website. It does not include guest accounts, enquiry submission forms, payment collection, advertising trackers or analytics scripts.</p><h2>Hosting</h2><p>The hosting provider may process technical information, including IP addresses and request logs, to deliver and protect the website. Its privacy terms apply to that processing.</p><h2>Contact and external links</h2><p>If you choose to contact the host by email, phone or WhatsApp, your chosen provider processes that communication under its own terms. External websites have their own privacy practices.</p><h2>Booking services</h2><p>{site.bookingUrl ? 'The booking link takes you to an external booking service. Review its privacy notice and booking conditions before providing information.' : 'Online booking is not active on this preview. This notice must be reviewed when booking or enquiry services are added.'}</p><h2>Contacting the operator</h2><p>{site.email ? <>For privacy questions, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</> : 'Operator contact information is being confirmed and will be published before launch.'}</p><p class="muted">Last reviewed: 12 November 2026.</p></article>
</Layout>
